              "back": "Movement from high to low concentration"
            },
            {
              "front": "What is osmosis?",
              "back": "Diffusion of water across a membrane"
            },
            {
              "front": "What is the powerhouse of the cell?",
              "back": "mitochondrion"
            },
            {
              "front": "What molecule carries genetic instructions?",
              "back": "DNA"
